"Rasid would take the prince's pardon and work for the headman, if anyone offered it."
"Rasid knows Barek leaves cheese at the dead oak, and spares the headman's flock for it."
"Rasid saw the waystone flare white at dawn from the tower top, and cannot decide what it meant."
"Rasid knows Dov and Makram talk of slavers, and sleeps with his sword to hand because of it."
"Rasid guesses young Aren is from Tavelford and has let him slip down at night."
